{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CfLsHwkXQDQWWWJFBnhnW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All checklist items complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Completed:**\n- [x] Enter on a focused category tab activates that tab and does not emit `emoji-select`\n- [x] Enter on a focused skin tone radio checks that radio and does not emit `emoji-select`\n- [x] ArrowLeft pressed in the search box leaves focus in the search box\n- [x] ArrowDown pressed in the search box moves focus into the grid\n- [x] Enter in the search box with a non-empty query emits `emoji-select` for the first visible emoji\n- [x] ArrowRight on a focused tone radio moves focus to and checks the next radio\n- [x] Existing tab arrow navigation and grid arrow navigation tests still pass\n\n**What changed:**\n- `src/picker.ts`: Replaced the monolithic `onKeydown` with a dispatcher that routes by `event.target` to separate handlers for grid cells (`onGridKeydown`), search input (`onSearchKeydown`), tabs (existing `onTabKeydown`), and tone radios (new `onToneKeydown`). Tabs and radios are no longer intercepted by the host handler.\n- `test/index.ts`: Added 7 new test cases (16 assertions). All 174 tests pass. Lint clean.\n- `AGENTS.md`: Added notes about stale DOM references after re-render, synthetic keydown limitations, and the dispatch pattern."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":80227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17b2a073-2dcb-44d7-adf3-864d54401ab0","uuid":"6ab28482-90eb-426e-aa4a-44cd8b2464b5","timestamp":"2026-09-23T18:46:23.384Z","request_id":"req_011CfLsHwGzw59zgRVW25APD"